WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:07.720
To fight against messengers from the future who are changing history to erase soccer...

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:13.950
...we, the Raimon Eleven, are now traveling through time to assemble the strongest eleven in history.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:17.300
I see...

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.700
They protect the ball with their feet to prevent it from being taken.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:24.040
Zhang Fei!

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.300
I won't let you do as you please!

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:28.920
Captain!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:31.940
Good, he got it!

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.600
Bring it in!

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:34.780
Okay!

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.980
Give it to me, Tenma!

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.920
Liu Bei?

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.610
Then that means...

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:50.340
No way.

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:54.240
The goal is wide open!

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.710
The goal is wide open!

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:36.400
W-Why?!

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:38.740
Wha- You can't do that, Liu Bei!

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:40.100
Go back!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.340
Why not?

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:44.520
With me joining in, there are more people and our attack power will increase.

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:48.890
But if they score while there's no one protecting the goal, we'll los-

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.020
Wide open.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:52.980
Oh no!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.650
Make it in, Zhang Fei!

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.740
Shindou-senpai!

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.960
As expected of Shindou.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:09.840
He saw Liu Bei-san moving up and fell back.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.020
Even so...

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.240
Let's go!

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.960
Tenma! Tsurugi!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.970
Fire Tornado Double Drive!

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:30.840
What?

00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:33.420
Yes!

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:33.850
Great!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:36.260
All right!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:37.600
What?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.650
How's that?

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.840
We win!

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:44.640
Change Guan Yu and Zhang Fei back to normal!

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:49.120
Retreat.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.200
Move Mode.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:02.560
This is...

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.340
Weren't we just outside earlier?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:10.300
Thank goodness! You're back to normal, Guan Yu! Zhang Fei!

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:12.560
When did we get here?

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.180
It's great to have you back!

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.110
El Dorado?

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.740
That's the name of the enemy that you are fighting?

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:24.080
Yes.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:29.620
You say that they are the ones who cast black magic on us and forced us to fight against our brother?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:30.580
That's right.

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:32.720
I'm sorry, honorable brother.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:36.420
To have wished harm upon my sworn brother brings me deepest shame.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:37.960
I'm sorry.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.520
I have been made a fool.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.660
Don't worry about it. It's all in the past.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:43.590
Honorable brother...

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.440
So those are the sorts of fellows that you've been fighting with.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.680
I'll lend you my help next time.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.260
Okay. Thanks, Taiyou!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:54.270
Do you have a second, Liu Bei?

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.480
What is it, Shinsuke?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:58.770
Um...

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:01.650
Back there, you were a failure as a goalkeeper.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.610
Failure? What do you mean?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:09.080
It's important for each person to fulfill their given role in soccer.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.040
Especially the goalkeeper.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:14.240
The goalkeeper needs to protect the goal properly!

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.580
Protect, eh?

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:19.640
All right, leave it to me!

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.480
That's right...

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:27.160
If we lose a match against El Dorado, we might never get soccer back again.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.660
We can't afford to lose.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.640
We can't allow even one point of failure!

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.860
Is this the next trap in Kongming's Fortress?

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:46.480
Looks like the perfect place for something to pop out.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.560
What just happened?

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:50.480
The doors...!

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.620
They disappeared!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:53.980
Everyone, be careful!

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.580
We don't know what that trap might contain!

00:05:57.060 --> 00:05:59.080
A ball made out of rope...

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.900
A blazing fire...

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:03.440
And I guess that's... a candlestick?

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.740
What does it mean?

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:07.050
Not a clue.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.520
Don't fret over it.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:12.760
If there's a fire going, we just have to put it out.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:16.730
I was just thinking that we should extinguish it, too!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.480
Wait!

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:21.120
Then what about the ball and candlestick?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.040
No idea.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.580
That's so irresponsible!

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:28.620
But if we keep hesitating, we'll be stuck here.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.360
Zhang Fei!

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:35.540
All right!

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:50.900
What on earth is going-

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:55.060
Hey, we got dumped right back to the front door!

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:57.240
Appears that way.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:00.280
This isn't funny!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:02.960
Now we're taking even longer to get inside!

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:04.340
So what?

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.240
All we need to do is start over.

00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:07.020
The goalkeeper-

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.320
That again?

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:12.620
The goalkeeper is the last point of defense.

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.330
That's why he has to be cautious.

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.540
There's no point being cautious if you won't be active about it.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.460
What I'm trying to say is...!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.750
All right, all right.

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:27.880
We'll figure it out this time.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.940
Liu Bei, you stay back.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.300
I'll do what I want.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:35.400
Tenma, let's solve this puzzle already.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:36.470
O-Okay...

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:42.300
Maybe this ball has a trick to it?

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:49.900
I see...

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.070
Fei, give me the ball.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:09.720
You did it, Tsurugi!

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.300
All right, let's move on to the next one!

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:15.300
What trap do you think is waiting for us next?

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:18.260
We'll know when we see it.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.700
What are these?

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:26.060
They look like dolls made out of clay...

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.040
They're terracotta warriors.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:29.800
Terracotta?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:34.400
Aren't those clay figures of warriors and horses buried inside a mausoleum?

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.180
Why are they in here?

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:38.160
In any case, let's keep moving.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.000
They're kind of creepy...

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:48.840
Are you scared, Kurama-senpai?

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.120
No!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.900
Nothing about them has changed, right?

00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:58.400
I think so...

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.240
T-They're a little closer than before, aren't they?

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.120
It's just your imagination...

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.420
T-T-They're a little closer...

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:15.700
I-It's your imagination!!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:27.800
The terracotta warriors!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.560
They can move!

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:31.140
They're terracotta puppets!

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.820
We're at a disadvantage in here! Run!

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:42.020
We're surrounded!

00:09:42.480 --> 00:09:46.980
Is Kongming against meeting with me that badly?

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.640
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.020
Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.860
What do we do?

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.860
Wha... This is a soccer ball!

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.460
A soccer field!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:17.160
I see! This is another one of the fortress's traps!

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:22.140
In order to move on, we need to win against these terracotta puppets in a soccer match, is that it?

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:27.600
Has Kongming been watching our soccer battles from somewhere?

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:34.800
I never thought we'd be playing soccer with puppets!

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.140
This will be a piece of cake!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.100
Tenma, I want to fight this time.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:41.020
Okay.

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:43.040
We're counting on you, Taiyou!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:45.080
I'll join as that goalkeeper role this time too.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:46.440
Liu Bei...

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.280
I'll be goalkeeper!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.880
I'm the one who has business with Kongming.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:57.300
If I don't join this fight and we win, I won't have any right to have an audience with Kongming.

00:10:57.660 --> 00:10:59.380
We need to win!

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.840
I'll protect the goal!

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:06.200
Shinsuke, Liu Bei never goes back on his decisions, so this is out of our hands.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.040
Besides, we're not up against El Dorado this time.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.020
No! I'm going!

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:13.360
Leave this to my honorable brother.

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:16.360
Let go!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.400
We... Raimon can't afford to lose!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.200
We have to protect our soccer!

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:32.600
We can't afford to lose...

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.860
I won't lose to puppets!

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:41.800
What?!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:47.060
You're not half bad, puppets!

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.360
All right, my brother!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:02.570
No, he hasn't fully stopped it.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:08.200
I'm not done yet!

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:12.340
Yes!

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.700
Good job, my brother!

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.460
Liu Bei...

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:21.400
All right, it's our turn now!

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.300
Go!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.060
Okay!

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:23.720
Tsurugi!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:25.590
Amemiya!

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:26.760
Okay!

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:30.060
Let's do this! It's my turn to be useful!

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:39.650
Sun God Apollo!

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.160
All right!

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:57.720
Nice shoot!

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:58.520
Yeah!

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:00.710
All right! I can do this!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.840
That attack right now was made possible by my honorable brother's defense.

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.440
You do admit to that?

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:07.550
Yes...

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:15.200
I won't let you through this time!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.340
What?!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.460
They're not just good at dribbling!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:24.740
That won't work against my honorable brother!

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:36.720
You're not getting it!

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:44.630
Liu Bei hurt his hand from that last catch!

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:45.760
What?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:46.300
What?!

00:13:47.440 --> 00:13:48.010
Are you serious?

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:49.220
No way...

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:53.140
Liu Bei, that arm won't be enough to get by!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.980
I still have my left!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.300
Why... are you going so far...

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:01.980
Once I've decided on something, I do it to completion!

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.700
He can't gather up his strength because of the pain!

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.660
It may not be able to catch, but it can act as a shield!

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:18.080
I won't let it happen!

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:19.820
Wow...

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:23.000
Once he's decided on something, he goes through with it no matter what.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.320
Even if it means having to travel through hell and back.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:28.050
That is Liu Xuande.

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:33.500
My brother has seen many suffering people.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.930
When our people were hit by droughts and floods,

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.380
response from government officials was slow even after it was brought to their attention.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.620
By the time they even bothered standing up to address it, it was already too late.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:49.300
Seeing the cycle of tragedy repeat itself continuously, my honorable brother decided that he himself would take action.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.950
He would save the people, before all was lost.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.160
For that, he would rule the country.

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:59.060
After deciding that, it was the only goal he has lived for.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:03.320
If he needs someone like Kongming to help rule the country,

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.380
he will keep going to Kongming with his head bowed low so that he may be heard.

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:07.760
That is our honorable brother!

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.680
That is why we are able to entrust our lives to him.

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.640
Liu Bei...

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.340
Liu Bei!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:33.040
Honorable brother!

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:40.600
Shinsuke, switch with me as goalkeeper!

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:42.720
He's choosing to give up?

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.620
My will has not yielded.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.420
I only protect what I can, that's all.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.960
I have something I want to protect, just like you.

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.890
I leave it to you, Shinsuke.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:57.100
Okay.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.560
Shinsuke, we're counting on you!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.060
Okay!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.060
This point that Liu Bei saved for us...

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.320
I've gotta protect it.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.570
This time!

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:19.910
H-Huh?

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:24.140
I'll stop it no matter what!

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:25.000
I'll stop it!

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:41.600
Shinsuke! Are you planning to put my brother's efforts in vain?!

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.380
Shinsuke?

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.000
Sorry...

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.440
It's still a tie. Don't worry about it.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.000
We'll win it back soon enough.

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.500
O-Okay...

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:55.500
I couldn't tell where it would come from...

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:57.240
I'm supposed to stop it...

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:01.940
Nishiki-senpai!

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.580
Denrai Houtou!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:21.890
Here it comes, Shinsuke!

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:27.200
I'll stop it this time!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.780
No, it's going in!

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:40.780
Mochi Mochi Soy Flour Mochi!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:45.520
Whoa there...

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:46.830
I cleared it!

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.720
That's awesome, Kinako!

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:52.820
I didn't know you came up with that technique!

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:55.620
I can make progress too, you know!

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.220
Thanks...

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:58.920
Don't worry.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:02.140
I was able to get it because you touched the ball, Shinsuke!

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:03.850
Yeah...

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:05.600
Shinsuke...

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:09.940
Shinsuke isn't moving like his usual self...

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.650
We need to lessen the burden on him...

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.540
Senpai...

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.900
I have to be more focused!

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.360
Which is it?

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:26.160
I can't read where the ball will come from!

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.100
What's wrong with Shinsuke?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:31.140
All of that tension is making him hesitant.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:32.380
Tension is making him hesitant?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:37.540
Humans have personal ticks, so after watching them a number of times, you are eventually able to predict their shoot course.

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.380
But the terracotta puppets have no such identifiable trait.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.240
That's what's causing him to be indecisive...

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:48.000
What's more, the large amount of strain that Shinsuke is under right now is affecting his judgment for the worse.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:49.100
No way...

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.220
Don't these guys get tired?

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:56.820
It's coming!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.740
Which is it? Which way is it coming?

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.950
If you're feeling indecisive, then fly!

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:11.260
No matter which way it comes, thinking about it first only wastes time!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:13.440
So, leave it all to luck and fly!

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:15.820
Leave it to luck?!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.780
That's so irresponsible!

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:19.500
It isn't!

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.700
I'm telling you not to let time go by!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:24.100
If you don't make a decision, you'll lose everything!

00:19:24.900 --> 00:19:27.440
<i>My honorable brother decided that he himself would take action.</i>

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.800
<i>Before all was lost.</i>

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.480
Shinsuke!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.720
Isn't there something you want to protect?!

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:35.840
Shinsuke!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:37.900
I...

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:39.990
...will protect soccer!

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:48.040
Full Throttle Punch!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.280
I stopped it...

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:58.840
Tenma!

00:19:58.840 --> 00:19:59.720
Okay!

00:19:59.720 --> 00:20:00.880
Nishiki-senpai!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:01.550
Taiyou!

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.930
Sun God Apollo!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:13.440
Sunshine Force!

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:31.400
The match is over!

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.660
All right!

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.620
Looks like you protected it.

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:37.840
Yes!

00:20:38.260 --> 00:20:39.540
Thank you!

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:41.160
We won.

00:20:41.160 --> 00:20:42.280
Yeah.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:44.340
Taiyou, thanks!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.800
You were involved in all the goals! As expected!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.930
I'm just glad to be of help to everyone!

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.800
Okay, everyone, let's go to Kongming!

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:53.810
Okay!

00:21:02.140 --> 00:21:03.280
How beautiful!

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.380
Kongming, time to keep your promise!

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.980
Show yourself!

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:11.740
If you don't, I'll shout at the top of my lungs such embarrassing words that it'll make anyone go red in the face!

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:19.280
Tenma.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:20.840
That person is...

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:22.760
Kongming, eh?

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:56.520
Shindou, what are you doing?

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.300
They released new cards.

00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:00.480
These, right?

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:02.940
As expected from you, Kirino. You got yours quick.

00:23:03.780 --> 00:23:04.660
This is...

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:06.940
Mixi-trans: Nobunaga!

00:23:08.760 --> 00:23:10.280
It's pretty amazing this time around!

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:12.220
Mixi-trans: Jeanne!

00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:13.200
Here, too!

00:23:14.320 --> 00:23:15.920
Let's fight, Shindou!

00:23:15.920 --> 00:23:16.560
Come on!

00:23:17.000 --> 00:23:19.720
Shine! The Power that Transcends Time!!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:22.620
The Taste of Autumn Promo Pack Campaign!

00:23:24.100 --> 00:23:26.840
A shocking encounter with Zhuge Kongming!

00:23:26.840 --> 00:23:30.570
And, at last, the veil over Zanark's team is cast off!

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:33.490
Next, Fierce Attack! Zanark Domain!!

00:23:33.530 --> 00:23:35.620
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:49.240
The Inazuma Eleven GO Chrono Stone's proverb today is...

00:23:53.640 --> 00:23:55.780
If you're feeling indecisive, then fly!

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:56.880
That's all!
